tools/quran-import/raw/gutenberg-16955/16955.txt
# Surah Preview (عن السورة): built by tools/surah-preview/import.mjs from QuranEnc's Mukhtasar pages (pinned in
# tools/surah-preview/source.lock.json, which stays tracked); redistribution terms unconfirmed, so never committed.
mobile/assets/surah-preview/*.partial
# Quranpedia's official surah-information dump, cached by import.mjs (pinned in tools/surah-preview/quranpedia.lock.json).
tools/surah-preview/source/
tools/surah-preview/source
# The scholarly review log (reviewer names, third-party text) and what review/apply.mjs builds from it: local, backed up
